396 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 217 0 R
/E (A prevailing sentiment seems to be that the incentives on SN are not working to curate content \(and maybe they aren't\). We should be cautious about overreacting to the actions of a particular bad actor, especially in the short term, though.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
397 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 217 0 R
/E (We're seeing general SN activity increasing \(zaps, unique stackers, item creation\), as the boosting vs downzapping battle rages. This is part of the mechanics of the site and it's at least directionally having the self-correcting effect we hope to see. More users making good content, supported by more zapping, makes boosting stuff to the top more costly for scammers and, more importantly, is exactly what we want for SN.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [14 546 0 R 16]
>>
endobj
