481 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 219 0 R
/E (Perhaps the group that comes across least sympathetic in Biggar's analysis is the modern left leaning academic. Biggar shows that much of modern scholarship is biased and agenda driven. He does this by showing examples of modern academics taking historical quotes out of context so that they can paint a more damning picture of European attitudes than is deserved. Biggar instead shows that European attitudes were varied and diverse, and that claims about European racism are often unfair and overstated.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
